   "title": "How to use · v1.1.0",
   "widgets_values": [
    "## How to use · v1.1.0\n\n**What it does:** MiniMax Music 3 text to music: write a caption and lyrics, get a song with vocals as mp3. Core ComfyUI nodes only.\n\n1. **Your inputs** (green group):\n   - **Caption**: the music description, in three parts: `Global Metadata:` (genre, BPM, key, mood, production), `Vocal Details:` (voice, delivery, harmonies), `Arrangement:` (instruments, what each section does).\n   - **Lyrics**: one line per sung line, with section tags in square brackets: `[Intro]`, `[Verse]`, `[Chorus]`, `[Bridge]`, `[Instrumental]`, `[Outro]`.\n   - **Longest length in seconds** (180 by default, the node allows up to 360): an upper limit. The model can end the song earlier.\n   - **Seed**: a new one every run. Set \"control after generate\" to fixed to keep a song.\n   - **Decode in tiles**: on, as in the template. See the note under group 5 (**Why the decode is tiled**) before turning it off.\n2. **Models**: the three loaders must show the files from the Downloads note. Nothing to change.\n3. **Prompt**: the **Caption + lyrics → song plan** node writes the song frame by frame (cfg_scale 1.7, top_k 50, the template's values). This is the first of two stages.\n4. **Sampling**: 30 steps, CFG 1.7, euler / simple, from the template. The length comes from the song plan.\n5. **Save**: press **Run**. The **Result** node saves the mp3 to `output/audio/MiniMax-Music-3/`.\n\n**What to expect:** On the test machine (RTX PRO 4000 Blackwell 24 GB) a run took about 1.7 s per second of music: the default caption and lyrics gave a 163 s song in 277 s. In a 120 s run (an earlier build of this graph, default limit 120) the song plan took 108 s and the sampler 83 s. On an RTX 3060 12 GB, v1.0.0 of this workflow (same three files, same settings, ComfyUI 0.43.1) took 2 min 20 s for 60 s and 4 min 28 s for 120 s of music. v1.1.0 was not run on a 3060. The mp3 is stereo, 44.1 kHz.\n\n**Tips from the test runs**\n- **The length is an upper limit.** With the default lyrics and seed 22112026 the song came out 163 s long at a limit of 180, 150 s at 240, and at 120 the file stopped at 120 s without the last line (\"goodnight\"). Give long lyrics room.\n- **Instrumental:** `Instrumental. No vocals` under `Vocal Details:` and only `[Intro]`, `[Instrumental]`, `[Outro]` as lyrics gave a 42 s piece without words at a limit of 60.\n- The same seed and settings gave the same mp3 on two ComfyUI instances.\n- Nobody listened to the test songs. They were checked by transcription, loudness and spectrogram.\n\n**Tested on:** ComfyUI 0.45.3 · RTX PRO 4000 Blackwell 24 GB · 64 GB RAM · 2026-11-22. Not verified on a 12 GB card in this version.\n"
   ]
  },
