   "title": "Why the decode is tiled",
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Why the decode is tiled\n\nThe template has both decodes and a switch; **Decode in tiles** in group 1 picks one.\n\nOne run each, 163 s default song, ComfyUI started with `--reserve-vram 13.5` on the 24 GB test card: the one-piece decode took 22.5 GiB (ComfyUI process); the whole run with the tiled decode (1536 / 64, the template's values) stayed at 11.2 GiB.\n\nThe two mp3 files differ by a signal-to-noise ratio of 44 dB. Not compared by ear.\n"
   ]
  }
